[@x/gt/abc]: [abc] is not a number
[@x/foo/3]: unrecognised operator /foo/
[@x/gt/3/1]: extra argument [/1] not allowed with /gt/ (write '/' or '~' in VALUE as %2F or %7E)
[@/gt/3]: column name missing
[@x/all/3]: operator /all/ not yet supported
[@+x/gt/3]: regex column names (leading '+') not yet supported
[@assert@x/gt/3]: assertions (@assert@) not yet supported
Filter invalid [@x]: expected @NAME<op>VALUE or @NAME<op>:NAME
[@x/gt/:]: column name missing after ':'
